---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Thanks, it’s on its way to me | Colin Robey" noindex description="Your message reached me. I’ll reply myself, usually within a business day or two.">
  <main id="main">
    <section class="page-hero" style="padding-block:clamp(4rem,3rem + 5vw,8rem)"><div class="wrap">
      <p class="hand" style="font-size:2rem; margin:0 0 .5rem">Got it.</p>
      <h1>Thanks. It’s on its way to me.</h1>
      <p class="lead">I read every one myself and usually reply within a business day or two. If you asked for a scorecard, it comes by email within a few days.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-pen" href="/insights/">Read something while you wait <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
    </div></section>
  </main>
</Base>
